{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"type RxDBCollectionConfig<T, TSchema> = Omit<BaseCollectionConfig<T, string, TSchema>, \"onInsert\" | \"onUpdate\" | \"onDelete\" | \"getKey\"> & object;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/rxdb-db-collection/src/rxdb.ts#L50","children":[{"type":"text","value":"rxdb.ts:50"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Configuration interface for RxDB collection options"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"type-declaration","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type Declaration"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"rxcollection","children":[{"type":"text","value":"rxCollection"}]},{"type":"code","value":"rxCollection: RxCollection<T, unknown, unknown, unknown>;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The RxCollection from a RxDB Database instance."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"syncbatchsize","children":[{"type":"text","value":"syncBatchSize?"}]},{"type":"code","value":"optional syncBatchSize: number;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The maximum number of documents to read from the RxDB collection\nin a single batch during the initial sync between RxDB and the\nin-memory TanStack DB collection."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"remarks","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Remarks"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defaults to "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"1000"},{"type":"text","value":" if not specified."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Larger values reduce the number of round trips to the storage\nengine but increase memory usage per batch."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Smaller values may lower memory usage and allow earlier\nstreaming of initial results, at the cost of more query calls."}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Adjust this depending on your expected collection size and\nperformance characteristics of the chosen RxDB storage adapter."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"type-parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"t","children":[{"type":"text","value":"T"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"T"},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"extends"}]},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"object"},{"type":"text","value":" = "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Record"},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"string"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"unknown"},{"type":"text","value":">"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The explicit type of items in the collection (highest priority). Use the document type of your RxCollection here."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tschema","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TSchema"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TSchema"},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"extends"}]},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"StandardSchemaV1"},{"type":"text","value":" = "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"never"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The schema type for validation and type inference (second priority)"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"remarks-2","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Remarks"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type resolution follows a priority order:"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":true,"start":1,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"If you provide an explicit type via generic parameter, it will be used"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"If no explicit type is provided but a schema is, the schema's output type will be inferred"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"You should provide EITHER an explicit type OR a schema, but not both, as they would conflict.\nNotice that primary keys in RxDB must always be a string."}]}],"headings":[{"id":"type-declaration","text":"Type Declaration","level":2},{"id":"rxcollection","text":"rxCollection","level":3},{"id":"syncbatchsize","text":"syncBatchSize?","level":3},{"id":"remarks","text":"Remarks","level":4},{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"t","text":"T","level":3},{"id":"tschema","text":"TSchema","level":3},{"id":"remarks-2","text":"Remarks","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\ntype RxDBCollectionConfig<T, TSchema> = Omit<BaseCollectionConfig<T, string, TSchema>, \"onInsert\" | \"onUpdate\" | \"onDelete\" | \"getKey\"> & object;\n```\n\nDefined in: [rxdb.ts:50](https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/rxdb-db-collection/src/rxdb.ts#L50)\n\nConfiguration interface for RxDB collection options\n\n## Type Declaration\n\n### rxCollection\n\n```ts\nrxCollection: RxCollection<T, unknown, unknown, unknown>;\n```\n\nThe RxCollection from a RxDB Database instance.\n\n### syncBatchSize?\n\n```ts\noptional syncBatchSize: number;\n```\n\nThe maximum number of documents to read from the RxDB collection\nin a single batch during the initial sync between RxDB and the\nin-memory TanStack DB collection.\n\n#### Remarks\n\n- Defaults to `1000` if not specified.\n- Larger values reduce the number of round trips to the storage\n  engine but increase memory usage per batch.\n- Smaller values may lower memory usage and allow earlier\n  streaming of initial results, at the cost of more query calls.\n\nAdjust this depending on your expected collection size and\nperformance characteristics of the chosen RxDB storage adapter.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### T\n\n`T` *extends* `object` = `Record`\\<`string`, `unknown`\\>\n\nThe explicit type of items in the collection (highest priority). Use the document type of your RxCollection here.\n\n### TSchema\n\n`TSchema` *extends* `StandardSchemaV1` = `never`\n\nThe schema type for validation and type inference (second priority)\n\n## Remarks\n\nType resolution follows a priority order:\n1. If you provide an explicit type via generic parameter, it will be used\n2. If no explicit type is provided but a schema is, the schema's output type will be inferred\n\nYou should provide EITHER an explicit type OR a schema, but not both, as they would conflict.\nNotice that primary keys in RxDB must always be a string.\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: RxDBCollectionConfig\ntitle: RxDBCollectionConfig\n---\n\n```ts\ntype RxDBCollectionConfig<T, TSchema> = Omit<BaseCollectionConfig<T, string, TSchema>, \"onInsert\" | \"onUpdate\" | \"onDelete\" | \"getKey\"> & object;\n```\n\nDefined in: [rxdb.ts:50](https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/rxdb-db-collection/src/rxdb.ts#L50)\n\nConfiguration interface for RxDB collection options\n\n## Type Declaration\n\n### rxCollection\n\n```ts\nrxCollection: RxCollection<T, unknown, unknown, unknown>;\n```\n\nThe RxCollection from a RxDB Database instance.\n\n### syncBatchSize?\n\n```ts\noptional syncBatchSize: number;\n```\n\nThe maximum number of documents to read from the RxDB collection\nin a single batch during the initial sync between RxDB and the\nin-memory TanStack DB collection.\n\n#### Remarks\n\n- Defaults to `1000` if not specified.\n- Larger values reduce the number of round trips to the storage\n  engine but increase memory usage per batch.\n- Smaller values may lower memory usage and allow earlier\n  streaming of initial results, at the cost of more query calls.\n\nAdjust this depending on your expected collection size and\nperformance characteristics of the chosen RxDB storage adapter.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### T\n\n`T` *extends* `object` = `Record`\\<`string`, `unknown`\\>\n\nThe explicit type of items in the collection (highest priority). Use the document type of your RxCollection here.\n\n### TSchema\n\n`TSchema` *extends* `StandardSchemaV1` = `never`\n\nThe schema type for validation and type inference (second priority)\n\n## Remarks\n\nType resolution follows a priority order:\n1. If you provide an explicit type via generic parameter, it will be used\n2. If no explicit type is provided but a schema is, the schema's output type will be inferred\n\nYou should provide EITHER an explicit type OR a schema, but not both, as they would conflict.\nNotice that primary keys in RxDB must always be a string.\n"}
